  <data name="DeliveryReturns" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Delivery &amp; Replacement</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DeliveryReturnsPage" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;p&gt;We deliver to all governorates of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan and we have safe and fast delivery.&lt;/p&gt;  

&lt;p&gt;* Please note that delivery times may vary from city to city.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;When should I request a replacement?&lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Replacement requests must be submitted &lt;strong&gt;within 48 hours&lt;/strong&gt; of receiving your order.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;How do I request a replacement?&lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Within 48 hours of receiving your order, if you are not satisfied and wish to return any product, please contact our Customer Service team using one of the following methods:
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Email:
            &lt;a href="mailto:support@gabrinijo.com"&gt;support@gabrinijo.com&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Call or WhatsApp:
            &lt;a href="tel:+962796194630"&gt;+962-79-619-46-30&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Reach out through our social media platforms.
        &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;

 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Please provide the following details:&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Order number&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Name of the item you wish to return&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Reason for the return&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;

 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Our Customer Service team will review your case and send you all the necessary instructions.
        This process is very simple.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;Items Eligible for Replacement&lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Unopened, unused products sealed in their original packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Defective items damaged or broken during shipping.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;br&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;Items Not Eligible for Replacement&lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;br&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Products purchased at a discounted price.&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Opened or used products.&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Any product issue reported after 48 hours from the time of delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;</value>
